line\\_1, starting at [0.0, 0.0] and ending at [0.75, 0.0];
line\\_2, starting at [0.75, 0.0] and ending at [0.75, 0.5];
line\\_3, starting at [0.75, 0.5] and ending at [0.0, 0.5];
line\\_4, starting at [0.0, 0.5] and ending at [0.0, 0.0].

